# Whitecap Depot (CIPlay vi_whitecap_depot): quest "The Fourth Sled" (8 steps)
# The depot yard (0 -4, 5 m), the log board at 0 -15, the winch lever at -1 9 and the shed locker at -3 8.5; the igloo
# camp (23 -21, 4 m) with Maren's sled at 19 -16, her box at 21 -18, her note at 24 -19; the polar bear round 23 -26.
# offset: set in phase 2.
island Whitecap Depot
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Fourth Sled
wait 5
expect animals Polar bear 1
expect hidden shedlocker
zone depot_yard
expect step 1
read Depot log
expect step 2
use shedlever
expect message winch is locked
expect hidden shedlocker
zone igloo_camp
expect step 3
kill Polar bear
expect step 4
read Maren's note
expect step 5
open Maren's sled box
wait 3
expect story shedkey 1
expect step 6
use shedlever
expect story shedopen 1
expect shown shedlocker
expect step 7
open Sled shed locker
expect done
